      ],
      "description": "<p>The living thunderclap emits a bolt of lightning that crashes with deafening thunder. The living thunderclap makes a lightning bolt Strike that deals <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d12</span> electricity damage. If it hits, the target and any creatures within a 15 foot emanation around the target take <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">2d6</span> sonic damage and must attempt a DC 18 basic Fortitude save.</p>\n<p>Any creature that fails its save is also Deafened for <span class=\"roll\" onclick=\"roll(this)\">1d4</span> rounds.</p>",
